<style>
*,*:before,*:after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{background:#06060d;color:#eef1f6;font-family:DM Sans,sans-serif;font-weight:400;line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}:root{--green: #00E891;--grn-dk: #009E60;--night: #06060D;--night-2: #0D0D1A;--night-3: #141422;--offwh: #EEF1F6;--muted: rgba(238,241,246,.45);--border: rgba(255,255,255,.07);--max: 1160px}.container{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}.logo{display:inline-flex;flex-direction:column;font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;line-height:1}.logo-name{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-.03em}.logo-name span{color:var(--green)}.logo-sub{font-size:7.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eef1f64d;margin-top:4px}.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:8px;border:none;font-family:DM Sans,sans-serif;font-weight:500;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;white-space:nowrap}.btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#2563EB,#00E891);color:var(--night)}.btn-primary:hover{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1D4ED8,#00ffA0);transform:translateY(-1px)}.btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--offwh);border:1px solid rgba(238,241,246,.2)}.btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--green);color:var(--green)}nav{position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;background:#06060de6;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.nav-inner{max-width:var(--max);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;height:68px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.nav-links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:32px;list-style:none}.nav-links a{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);transition:color .2s}.nav-links a:hover,.nav-links a.active{color:var(--offwh)}.nav-cta{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.page-hero{padding:140px 0 72px;background:var(--night-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.page-tag{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--green);margin-bottom:16px}.page-title{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,56px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05;margin-bottom:16px}.page-sub{font-size:18px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f699;max-width:600px;line-height:1.65}.stages-section{padding:80px 0}.stages-intro{max-width:700px;margin-bottom:64px}.stages-intro p{font-size:16px;color:#eef1f6b3;line-height:1.75}.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr;gap:0;margin-bottom:2px;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);transition:border-color .2s}.stage:hover{border-color:rgba(0,232,145,0.2)}.stage-label{background:var(--night-3);padding:36px 24px 32px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;border-right:1px solid var(--border)}.stage-code{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--green);line-height:1}.stage-dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--border);margin-top:12px}.stage.highlight .stage-dot{background:var(--green)}.stage-content{background:var(--night-2);padding:32px 36px}.stage-name{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:8px}.stage-badge{display:inline-block;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:14px}.badge-free{color:var(--green);background:rgba(0,232,145,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,.2)}.badge-paid{color:#60a5fa;background:#60a5fa14;border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,.2)}.badge-optional{color:#eef1f680;background:#eef1f60d;border:1px solid rgba(238,241,246,.1)}.stage-desc{font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6b3;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:16px}.stage-deliverable{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}.stage-deliverable strong{color:var(--offwh);font-weight:500}.stage-time{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:10px}.connector{display:flex;justify-content:flex-start;padding-left:49px;margin:0;height:24px;align-items:center}.connector-line{width:2px;height:24px;background:rgba(0,232,145,0.15)}.table-section{padding:80px 0;background:var(--night-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.section-title{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:32px;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:8px}.section-sub{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:40px}.time-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.time-table th{text-align:left;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.time-table td{padding:16px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);font-size:14px;vertical-align:top}.time-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.time-table tr:hover td{background:#ffffff05}.td-stage{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:700;color:var(--green);width:80px}.td-name{font-weight:500;width:200px}.td-time{color:var(--muted);width:160px}.td-cost{width:180px}.cost-free{color:var(--green);font-weight:500}.cost-paid{color:var(--offwh);font-weight:500}.faq-section{padding:80px 0}.faq-list{max-width:760px;margin-top:40px}details{border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;margin-bottom:8px;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s}details[open]{border-color:rgba(0,232,145,0.25)}summary{padding:20px 24px;font-size:15px;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}summary:after{content:"+";font-size:20px;color:var(--green);flex-shrink:0;font-weight:300;transition:transform .2s}details[open] summary:after{transform:rotate(45deg)}.faq-answer{padding:0 24px 20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6b3;line-height:1.75}.choose-section{padding:80px 0;background:var(--night-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.criteria-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;margin-top:40px}.criterion{background:var(--night-3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;transition:border-color .2s}.criterion:hover{border-color:rgba(0,232,145,0.2)}.criterion-num{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:.1em;margin-bottom:10px}.criterion-q{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin-bottom:10px;line-height:1.3}.criterion-a{font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6a6;line-height:1.7;margin:0}.compare-section{padding:80px 0}.compare-table-wrap{overflow-x:auto;margin-top:40px;margin-bottom:48px}.compare-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;min-width:700px}.compare-table th{padding:14px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--muted)}.compare-table th span{font-weight:400;display:block;font-size:10px;margin-top:2px}.compare-table th.col-3gi{color:var(--green);background:rgba(0,232,145,0.04);border-top:2px solid var(--green);border-radius:4px 4px 0 0}.compare-table td{padding:14px 16px;font-size:13px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);color:#eef1f6a6;vertical-align:middle}.compare-table td.row-label{text-align:left;font-weight:500;color:var(--offwh);font-size:13px}.compare-table td.col-3gi{background:rgba(0,232,145,0.05);color:var(--offwh);font-weight:500}.compare-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none}.compare-table tr:hover td{background:#ffffff05}.compare-table tr:hover td.col-3gi{background:#00e8910d}.check{color:var(--green);font-style:normal}.cross{color:#eef1f640;font-style:normal}.partial{color:var(--green);font-style:normal}.fit-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px}.fit-card{border-radius:12px;padding:28px 32px}.fit-card.fit-yes{background:#00e8910d;border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,.2)}.fit-card.fit-no{background:#eef1f608;border:1px solid var(--border)}.fit-title{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:16px;margin-bottom:16px}.fit-card.fit-yes .fit-title{color:var(--green)}.fit-card.fit-no .fit-title{color:var(--muted)}.fit-list{list-style:none;padding:0}.fit-list li{font-size:14px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6b3;line-height:1.6;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);padding:6px 0 6px 18px;position:relative}.fit-list li:last-child{border-bottom:none}.fit-card.fit-yes .fit-list li:before{content:"✓";position:absolute;left:0;color:var(--green);font-size:12px}.fit-card.fit-no .fit-list li:before{content:"✗";position:absolute;left:0;color:#eef1f633;font-size:12px}.cta-section{padding:80px 0;background:var(--night-2);border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.cta-box{max-width:640px}.cta-title{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:20px}.cta-sub{font-size:17px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6a6;margin-bottom:32px;line-height:1.65}.cta-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}footer{padding:40px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}.footer-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer-links{display:flex;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.footer-links a{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);transition:color .2s}.footer-links a:hover{color:var(--offwh)}.footer-copy{font-size:12px;color:#eef1f640}.spectrum-section{padding:80px 0;background:var(--night-2);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.spectrum-header{max-width:680px;margin-bottom:40px}.spectrum-bar-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);border-radius:6px;overflow:hidden;height:6px;margin-bottom:8px}.spectrum-bar-labels{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(9,1fr);margin-bottom:36px}.bar-label{text-align:center;font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;color:#eef1f64d;padding-top:5px}.spectrum-groups{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-bottom:32px}.spectrum-group{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border)}.spectrum-group-header{padding:14px 20px 12px;font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.spectrum-group.g-era1 .spectrum-group-header{color:#f97316;background:#f973160f;border-color:#f9731626}.spectrum-group.g-era2 .spectrum-group-header{color:#eab308;background:#eab3080f;border-color:#eab30826}.spectrum-group.g-era3 .spectrum-group-header{color:var(--green);background:#00e8910f;border-color:#00e89126}.spectrum-sub{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:14px 20px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.04);background:var(--night-3);position:relative}.spectrum-sub:last-child{border-bottom:none}.sub-dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:5px}.sub-info{flex:1}.sub-header{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px}.sub-name{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--offwh)}.sub-score{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.sub-desc{font-size:12px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f680;line-height:1.55}.sub-badge{position:absolute;top:10px;right:12px;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#eab308;background:#eab3081a;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:10px}.spectrum-note{padding:20px 28px;background:rgba(0,232,145,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,.12);border-radius:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap}.spectrum-note-text{font-size:15px;font-weight:300;color:#eef1f6b3;line-height:1.6}.spectrum-note-text strong{color:var(--offwh);font-weight:500}@media(max-width:768px){.criteria-grid,.fit-grid,.spectrum-groups{grid-template-columns:1fr}.spectrum-bar-row,.spectrum-bar-labels{display:none}}@media(max-width:640px){[style*="grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}[style*="grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr"]{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.table-section{overflow-x:auto}.time-table{min-width:420px}.nav-links{display:none}.stage{grid-template-columns:72px 1fr}.stage-label{padding:24px 12px}.stage-code{font-size:20px}.stage-content{padding:24px 20px}.connector{padding-left:35px}.time-table .td-time,.time-table .td-cost{display:none}.cta-actions{flex-direction:column}}
.flow-section{margin-bottom:48px}.flow-track{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:0;overflow-x:auto;padding:8px 0 16px;scrollbar-width:none}.flow-track::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.flow-node{flex:1;min-width:120px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:0 6px}.flow-inner{background:var(--night-3);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:16px 10px 14px;width:100%;transition:border-color .2s,transform .2s,box-shadow .2s;cursor:default}.flow-inner:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}.fn-free .flow-inner{border-color:rgba(0,232,145,.35)}.fn-free .flow-inner:hover{border-color:var(--green);box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,232,145,.1)}.fn-paid .flow-inner{border-color:rgba(96,165,250,.25)}.fn-paid .flow-inner:hover{border-color:rgba(96,165,250,.55)}.fn-opt .flow-inner{border-color:rgba(238,241,246,.1)}.fn-opt .flow-inner:hover{border-color:rgba(238,241,246,.22)}.flow-code{font-family:Syne,sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:20px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1;margin-bottom:6px}.fn-free .flow-code{color:var(--green)}.fn-paid .flow-code{color:#60a5fa}.fn-opt .flow-code{color:var(--muted)}.flow-lbl{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;color:var(--offwh);line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:9px;min-height:28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center}.flow-cost{font-size:9px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:10px;display:inline-block}.fn-free .flow-cost{color:var(--green);background:#00e89112;border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,.2)}.fn-paid .flow-cost{color:#60a5fa;background:#60a5fa12;border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,.15)}.fn-opt .flow-cost{color:var(--muted);background:#eef1f608;border:1px solid rgba(238,241,246,.08)}.flow-sep{flex-shrink:0;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;padding-top:28px;color:#00e89133}.flow-sep svg{width:20px;height:14px}@media(max-width:700px){.flow-track{flex-direction:column;overflow-x:visible;padding:0}.flow-node{min-width:unset;width:100%;padding:0 0 0 0;flex-direction:row;gap:12px;align-items:stretch}.flow-inner{flex:1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:52px 1fr auto;align-items:center;gap:4px 12px;padding:14px 16px;text-align:left}.flow-code{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:0;grid-row:1/3}.flow-lbl{margin-bottom:0;min-height:unset;justify-content:flex-start}.flow-cost{grid-column:3;grid-row:1/3;align-self:center}.flow-sep{padding-top:0;padding-left:24px;height:20px;align-items:center;width:100%}.flow-sep svg{transform:rotate(90deg)}}</style>

<Layout title="Methodology · From zero to operational AI · 3G Intelligence" description="Free ERA Test → Radar → Flight Plan → Autopilot. A clear path for SMBs to adopt AI, with concrete deliverables and measurable ROI." lang="en">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="page-tag" data-i18n="met-tag">How we work</div><h1 class="page-title" data-i18n="met-title">From zero to operational AI<br>with a clear path.</h1><p class="page-sub" data-i18n="met-sub">Structured methodology, concrete deliverables, defined timelines. You know exactly what you'll receive — and when.</p></div></section><section style="display:block; padding:80px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);" id="era-dos-dimensiones"><div class="container"><div class="spectrum-header"><div class="page-tag" data-i18n="met-fw-tag">3GI Framework</div><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-fw-title">ERA has two dimensions</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-fw-sub">These aren't two separate frameworks — it's the same ERA viewed from two axes. A company can operate perfectly and not grow. Or sell very well and not handle the growth. Both things matter.</p></div><!-- Dos ejes --><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:16px; margin:48px 0 56px;"><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,0.3); border-radius:14px; padding:28px 24px;"><div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#FBBF24; margin-bottom:12px;" data-i18n="met-op-label">Operational ERA</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:12px;" data-i18n="met-op-q">Can it handle<br>the demand?</div><p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.55); line-height:1.6;" data-i18n="met-op-desc">Data, processes, technology, automation. What makes the company work when it grows.</p></div><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.3); border-radius:14px; padding:28px 24px;"><div style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#F97316; margin-bottom:12px;" data-i18n="met-com-label">Commercial ERA</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:12px;" data-i18n="met-com-q">Can it generate<br>the demand?</div><p style="font-size:14px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.55); line-height:1.6;" data-i18n="met-com-desc">How new clients arrive, how they're retained, how the company grows without depending solely on the owner.</p></div></div><!-- 4 arquetipos --><div style="margin-bottom:48px;"><p style="font-size:11px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.35); margin-bottom:24px; text-align:center;" data-i18n="met-archetypes-label">The 4 archetypes</p><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:12px;"><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(249,115,22,0.25); border-radius:12px; padding:22px 20px;"><div style="font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#F97316; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a1-badge">Low Ops · High Sales</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a1-title">The success trap</div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.5); line-height:1.5;" data-i18n="met-a1-desc">Sells well. Can't keep up. Every new client pressures a system that's already creaking.</p></div><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(96,165,250,0.25); border-radius:12px; padding:22px 20px;"><div style="font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#60A5FA; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a2-badge">High Ops · Low Sales</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a2-title">The invisible company</div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.5); line-height:1.5;" data-i18n="met-a2-desc">Operates perfectly. The market can't find it. It's not a quality problem — it's a visibility problem.</p></div><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,0.25); border-radius:12px; padding:22px 20px;"><div style="font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#F87171; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a3-badge">Low Ops · Low Sales</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a3-title">Foundation first</div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.5); line-height:1.5;" data-i18n="met-a3-desc">Challenges on both dimensions. The first step unlocks both.</p></div><div style="background:#0E0E1A; border:1px solid rgba(0,232,145,0.25); border-radius:12px; padding:22px 20px;"><div style="font-size:10px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.12em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#00E891; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a4-badge">High Ops · High Sales</div><div style="font-family:'Syne',sans-serif; font-size:17px; font-weight:800; color:#EEF1F6; margin-bottom:8px;" data-i18n="met-a4-title">On the way to ERA 3</div><p style="font-size:13px; color:rgba(238,241,246,0.5); line-height:1.5;" data-i18n="met-a4-desc">Both dimensions work. The next step: AI integration to amplify them.</p></div></div></div><!-- CTA --><div class="spectrum-note"><p class="spectrum-note-text" data-i18n="met-fw-note">The ERA Test measures <strong>both dimensions</strong> — operational and commercial. In less than 5 minutes you know exactly which quadrant your company is in.</p><a href="/test-era?modo=ambas" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="met-fw-cta">See my full ERA Test →</a></div></div></section><section class="spectrum-section" id="espectro"><div class="container"><div class="spectrum-header"><div class="page-tag" data-i18n="met-spec-tag">3GI Framework</div><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-spec-title">Your exact position in the spectrum</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-spec-sub">Within the operational axis, there are 9 precision positions. Not all ERA 2s are equal — a company with a score of 2.5 and one with 3.4 need completely different roadmaps. The 3GI Diagnosis places you exactly.</p></div><!-- Gradient bar --><div class="spectrum-bar-row"><div style="background:#DC2626"></div><div style="background:#EF4444"></div><div style="background:#F97316"></div><div style="background:#EAB308"></div><div style="background:#CA8A04"></div><div style="background:#65A30D"></div><div style="background:#16A34A"></div><div style="background:#15803D"></div><div style="background:#166534"></div></div><div class="spectrum-bar-labels"><span class="bar-label">ERA 1-</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 1</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 1+</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 2-</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 2</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 2+</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 3-</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 3</span><span class="bar-label">ERA 3+</span></div><!-- 9 sub-niveles --><div class="spectrum-groups"><div class="spectrum-group g-era1"><div class="spectrum-group-header" data-i18n="met-era1-header">ERA 1 — Operational Chaos</div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#DC2626"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 1-</span><span class="sub-score">1.0–1.5</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era1m-desc">Everything in the owner's head. No written processes or tools. Zero documentation.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#EF4444"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 1</span><span class="sub-score">1.5–2.0</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era1-desc">There's Excel but each person has their own. The information exists — nobody shares or uses it to make decisions.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#F97316"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 1+</span><span class="sub-score">2.0–2.5</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era1p-desc">Tools adopted, but they don't talk to each other. Data trapped in silos with no integration.</div></div></div></div><div class="spectrum-group g-era2"><div class="spectrum-group-header" data-i18n="met-era2-header">ERA 2 — Organized Data</div><div class="spectrum-sub"><span class="sub-badge" data-i18n="met-era2-badge">Most SMBs</span><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#EAB308"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 2-</span><span class="sub-score">2.5–2.9</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era2m-desc">Centralized system, but nobody uses it to decide. Reports are still built manually.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#CA8A04"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 2</span><span class="sub-score">2.9–3.2</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era2-desc">Data flows. Reports exist. AI is not on the radar — but the ground is ready.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#65A30D"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 2+</span><span class="sub-score">3.2–3.5</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era2p-desc">Experimenting with AI on a case-by-case basis, without strategy. Inconsistent results, difficult to scale.</div></div></div></div><div class="spectrum-group g-era3"><div class="spectrum-group-header" data-i18n="met-era3-header">ERA 3 — AI-Powered Company</div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#16A34A"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 3-</span><span class="sub-score">3.5–4.0</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era3m-desc">AI running in 1–2 processes. Visible ROI. The team begins adapting to the new operational pace.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#15803D"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 3</span><span class="sub-score">4.0–4.5</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era3-desc">AI integrated into core operations. Real-time data-based decisions, without manual friction.</div></div></div><div class="spectrum-sub"><div class="sub-dot" style="background:#00E891"></div><div class="sub-info"><div class="sub-header"><span class="sub-name">ERA 3+</span><span class="sub-score">4.5–5.0</span></div><div class="sub-desc" data-i18n="met-era3p-desc">AI as a structural competitive advantage. The system learns and improves without manual intervention.</div></div></div></div></div><div class="spectrum-note"><p class="spectrum-note-text" data-i18n="met-spec-note"><strong>The ERA Test identifies your exact sub-level</strong> — not just the ERA. That precision defines the right roadmap from day one.</p><a href="/en/test-era" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="met-spec-cta">Discover my sub-level →</a></div></div></section><section class="stages-section" id="metodologia"><div class="container"><div class="stages-intro"><p data-i18n="met-stages-intro">Every company starts from a different point. The methodology allows entry at the right phase: some companies go through the whole journey, others jump straight to the Flight Plan. The important thing is to never skip the ERA Test.</p></div><div class="flow-section"><div class="flow-track"><div class="flow-node fn-free"><a class="flow-inner" href="#diagnostico" style="text-decoration:none"><div class="flow-code">✓</div><div class="flow-lbl" data-i18n="met-row-diag-name">Test ERA</div><div class="flow-cost" data-i18n="met-diag-badge">Free</div></a></div><div class="flow-sep"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 14" fill="none"><path d="M0 7h16M10 1l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="flow-node fn-free"><a class="flow-inner" href="#radar" style="text-decoration:none"><div class="flow-code">📡</div><div class="flow-lbl" data-i18n="met-flow-radar">Radar</div><div class="flow-cost" data-i18n="met-radar-badge">From USD 1,200</div></a></div><div class="flow-sep"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 14" fill="none"><path d="M0 7h16M10 1l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="flow-node fn-opt"><a class="flow-inner" href="#data-foundation" style="text-decoration:none"><div class="flow-code">🗄️</div><div class="flow-lbl" data-i18n="met-row-f2-name">Data Foundation</div><div class="flow-cost" data-i18n="met-f2-badge">Optional, if applicable</div></a></div><div class="flow-sep"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 14" fill="none"><path d="M0 7h16M10 1l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="flow-node fn-paid"><a class="flow-inner" href="#plan-de-vuelo" style="text-decoration:none"><div class="flow-code">🧭</div><div class="flow-lbl" data-i18n="met-flow-pdv">Flight Plan</div><div class="flow-cost" data-i18n="met-pdv-badge">From USD 6,700</div></a></div><div class="flow-sep"><svg viewBox="0 0 20 14" fill="none"><path d="M0 7h16M10 1l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><div class="flow-node fn-paid"><a class="flow-inner" href="#piloto-automatico" style="text-decoration:none"><div class="flow-code">🛩️</div><div class="flow-lbl" data-i18n="met-flow-piloto">Autopilot</div><div class="flow-cost" data-i18n="met-piloto-badge">USD 1,500-8,000/mo</div></a></div></div></div><!-- Test ERA --><div class="stage highlight" id="diagnostico"><div class="stage-label"><div class="stage-code" style="font-size:18px;">01</div><div class="stage-dot"></div></div><div class="stage-content"><div class="stage-name" data-i18n="met-diag-name">ERA Test · ERA Report</div><span class="stage-badge badge-free" data-i18n="met-diag-badge">Gratuito</span><p class="stage-desc" data-i18n="met-diag-desc">A 15-minute form where we identify your company's 3 biggest operational pain points and AI potential. Within 24–48 hours you receive a Diagnosis Report with the current gap vs. ideal state, the processes with the greatest opportunity, and the recommended next step.</p><p class="stage-deliverable" data-i18n="met-diag-deliverable"><strong>Deliverable:</strong> ERA Report PDF + next-phase recommendation.</p><p class="stage-time" data-i18n="met-diag-time">⏱ 15 min your time · 24–48 h for the report</p></div></div><div class="connector"><div class="connector-line"></div></div><!-- Radar --><div class="stage" id="radar"><div class="stage-label"><div class="stage-code">02</div><div class="stage-dot"></div></div><div class="stage-content"><div class="stage-name" data-i18n="met-radar-name">Radar · Express or 360</div><span class="stage-badge badge-paid" data-i18n="met-radar-badge2">From USD 1,200</span><p class="stage-desc" data-i18n="met-radar-desc">A paid diagnosis: where your company stands today and what opportunities exist. <strong>Radar Express</strong> is one session with leadership, priced by company size. <strong>Radar 360</strong> is a complete walk through your company (interviews with 4-6 areas) plus tactical Quick Wins. Neither includes scoring, ROI, or a PRD: that's Flight Plan's job.</p><p class="stage-deliverable" data-i18n="met-radar-deliverable"><strong>Entregable:</strong> Score de Madurez IA, clasificación ERA, informe ejecutivo con oportunidades identificadas.</p><p class="stage-time" data-i18n="met-radar-time">⏱ ~45 min to 2 hours depending on company size and variant</p></div></div><div class="connector"><div class="connector-line"></div></div><!-- Data Foundation --><div class="stage" id="data-foundation"><div class="stage-label"><div class="stage-code">✓?</div><div class="stage-dot"></div></div><div class="stage-content"><div class="stage-name" data-i18n="met-f2-name">Data Foundation</div><span class="stage-badge badge-optional" data-i18n="met-f2-badge2">Optional, determined by your Radar</span><p class="stage-desc" data-i18n="met-f2-desc">AI only works well with quality data. You don't choose this: your Radar determines whether your data already qualifies (direct certification) or whether there are gaps that require a prior project, cleaning, structuring and integrating your sources (ERP, CRM, Excel, emails, PDFs) before moving on to Flight Plan.</p><p class="stage-deliverable" data-i18n="met-f2-deliverable">✓ On completing any level, or if your data already qualified, we issue the Data Foundation Certificate (code DRC-DF), valid for 12 months.</p><p class="stage-time" data-i18n="met-f2-time">⏱ 2 to 8 weeks depending on the company's data maturity, if a project applies</p></div></div><div class="connector"><div class="connector-line"></div></div><!-- Plan de Vuelo --><div class="stage" id="plan-de-vuelo"><div class="stage-label"><div class="stage-code">03</div><div class="stage-dot"></div></div><div class="stage-content"><div class="stage-name" data-i18n="met-pdv-name">Flight Plan</div><span class="stage-badge badge-paid" data-i18n="met-pdv-badge2">From USD 6,700</span><p class="stage-desc" data-i18n="met-pdv-desc">Here, and only here, do we quantify, design, and build. Quantified scoring with 12-month ROI, deep process analysis, a complete technical PRD, and hands-on implementation until the return is real. The final price depends on how many opportunities you pursue and how complex the solution is, quoted once your Radar closes.</p><p class="stage-deliverable" data-i18n="met-pdv-deliverable"><strong>Entregable:</strong> Roadmap cuantificado con ROI, PRD técnico completo, y la solución construida y funcionando.</p><p class="stage-time" data-i18n="met-pdv-time">⏱ Weeks to months, depending on the scope defined after your Radar</p></div></div><div class="connector"><div class="connector-line"></div></div><!-- Piloto Automático --><div class="stage" id="piloto-automatico"><div class="stage-label"><div class="stage-code">04</div><div class="stage-dot"></div></div><div class="stage-content"><div class="stage-name" data-i18n="met-piloto-name">Autopilot</div><span class="stage-badge badge-paid" data-i18n="met-piloto-badge2">USD 1,500-8,000/mo</span><p class="stage-desc" data-i18n="met-piloto-desc">Once on the new heading, this keeps you there: ongoing support and evolution of the solutions already implemented. 3 levels by monthly hours: Basic (5-10h), Standard (10-20h), Advanced (20-40h), quoted after implementation.</p><p class="stage-deliverable" data-i18n="met-piloto-deliverable"><strong>Resultado:</strong> Empresa con ventaja competitiva estructural basada en IA, sostenida en el tiempo.</p><p class="stage-time" data-i18n="met-piloto-time">⏱ Ongoing · monthly</p></div></div></div></section><section class="table-section" id="resumen"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-table-title">Phase summary</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-table-sub">Quick reference for timelines and investment per phase.</p><table class="time-table"><thead><tr><th data-i18n="met-th-phase">Phase</th><th data-i18n="met-th-name">Name</th><th data-i18n="met-th-duration">Estimated duration</th><th data-i18n="met-th-investment">Reference investment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="td-stage">01</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-diag-name">Test ERA</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-diag-time">15 min + 24–48 h report</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-free" data-i18n="met-row-diag-cost">Free</span></td></tr><tr><td class="td-stage">02</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-radar-name">Radar Express</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-radar-time">~45 min – 2 hours</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-paid">USD 1.200–3.500</span></td></tr><tr><td class="td-stage">02</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-radar360-name">Radar 360</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-radar360-time">~45 min – 2 hours</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-paid">USD 6.000</span></td></tr><tr><td class="td-stage">✓?</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-f2-name">Data Foundation</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-f2-time">2–8 weeks, if it applies</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-paid">USD 800–15.000</span></td></tr><tr><td class="td-stage">03</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-pdv-name">Flight Plan</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-pdv-time">Weeks to months</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-paid">Desde USD 6.700</span></td></tr><tr><td class="td-stage">04</td><td class="td-name" data-i18n="met-row-piloto-name">Autopilot</td><td class="td-time" data-i18n="met-row-piloto-time">Ongoing, monthly</td><td class="td-cost"><span class="cost-paid">USD 1.500–8.000/mes</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="faq-section" id="faq"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-faq-sub">The most common doubts before getting started.</p><div class="faq-list"><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq1-q">How long does the initial diagnosis take?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq1-a">The ERA Test is a 15-minute form and the report is delivered within 24–48 hours. Your Radar takes between 45 minutes (Express) and 2 hours (360), and includes interviews and an executive report with identified opportunities.</p></details><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq2-q">Do I need to have my data in order before starting?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq2-a">No. Data Foundation exists precisely to organize and structure your data before implementing AI — your Radar determines whether you need it. Many clients start with scattered Excel files or without a centralized database.</p></details><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq3-q">How much ROI can I expect?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq3-a">It depends on the process and the company. In our documented cases, a distributor achieved +263% projected ROI in the first year, reducing quote time from 45 to 5 minutes and implementing 24/7 customer service.</p></details><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq4-q">What's the minimum to start working with 3GI?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq4-a">The ERA Test is free. If you decide to move forward, Radar Express starts at USD 1,200 (depending on company size). There's no long-term commitment until you see the full diagnosis and roadmap.</p></details><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq5-q">Do you work with companies outside Chile?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq5-a">Yes. We work with SMBs across Latin America. The process is 100% remote from diagnosis to implementation.</p></details><details><summary data-i18n="met-faq6-q">What if my company doesn't have a technical team?</summary><p class="faq-answer" data-i18n="met-faq6-a">That's not necessary. 3GI handles the complete technical implementation. We train your team to operate the solutions without requiring deep technical knowledge.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="choose-section" id="como-elegir"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-choose-title">How to choose the right AI partner?</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-choose-sub">Five questions you should ask any consultancy before hiring.</p><div class="criteria-grid"><div class="criterion"><div class="criterion-num">01</div><div class="criterion-q" data-i18n="met-c1-q">Does it start with a diagnosis or does it already have the solution?</div><p class="criterion-a" data-i18n="met-c1-a">A serious consultancy can't recommend what to implement without first understanding your operations. If in the first meeting they're already selling you a specific solution, that's a red flag.</p></div><div class="criterion"><div class="criterion-num">02</div><div class="criterion-q" data-i18n="met-c2-q">Does it have cases with documented measurable ROI?</div><p class="criterion-a" data-i18n="met-c2-a">Not "efficiency improvements" or "estimated time savings." Real numbers: what it cost, what it returned, in what timeframe. Without that, you're buying promises.</p></div><div class="criterion"><div class="criterion-num">03</div><div class="criterion-q" data-i18n="met-c3-q">Do they implement or just deliver reports?</div><p class="criterion-a" data-i18n="met-c3-a">Many consultancies end up with a PowerPoint. The real value is having the automation running in production. Ask who builds and who delivers.</p></div><div class="criterion"><div class="criterion-num">04</div><div class="criterion-q" data-i18n="met-c4-q">Does the project end with your team trained or dependent?</div><p class="criterion-a" data-i18n="met-c4-a">If after the project you need to keep paying the same provider for everything to work, you didn't buy a solution — you bought a hidden subscription.</p></div><div class="criterion"><div class="criterion-num">05</div><div class="criterion-q" data-i18n="met-c5-q">Does it understand the business or just the technology?</div><p class="criterion-a" data-i18n="met-c5-a">AI well applied solves business problems, not technical problems. Your partner should be talking about processes, margins, and ROI before talking about models and APIs.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="compare-section" id="comparacion"><div class="container"><h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="met-cmp-title">3GI vs. other alternatives</h2><p class="section-sub" data-i18n="met-cmp-sub">How working with 3G Intelligence compares to the most common options.</p><div class="compare-table-wrap"><table class="compare-table"><thead><tr><th></th><th class="col-3gi">3G Intelligence</th><th data-i18n="met-cmp-th2">Large consultancies<br/><span>(Accenture, Deloitte)</span></th><